usage: verify_llama_rope.py [-h] [--repo REPO] --report REPORT
                            [--threads THREADS]

Run offline RoPE checks on a source checkout; missing tests never count as
PASS.

options:
  -h, --help         show this help message and exit
  --repo REPO        Patched TICO source checkout, including test/.
  --report REPORT
  --threads THREADS
usage: export_regression.py [-h] {run,isolation,_worker,compare} ...

Compare actual exports from two source trees and after candidate eager use.
Run this file directly so the coordinator does not import TICO from the wrong
checkout. Workers use the same interpreter and the same trusted frozen Torch
checkpoint. No calibration, model download, or NPU execution is performed.

positional arguments:
  {run,isolation,_worker,compare}
    run                 Export both revisions and candidate after eager use.
    isolation           Compare only candidate export before/after eager use.
    _worker             ==SUPPRESS==
    compare             Compare previously collected phase directories.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
usage: export_regression.py run [-h] --baseline-repo BASELINE_REPO
                                [--candidate-repo CANDIDATE_REPO] --config
                                CONFIG --checkpoint CHECKPOINT --output OUTPUT
                                --seq-len SEQ_LEN --eager-seq-len
                                EAGER_SEQ_LEN [--eager-inputs EAGER_INPUTS]
                                [--include-full-text] [--migrate-llama-rope]
                                [--decode-steps DECODE_STEPS]
                                [--artifacts ARTIFACTS] [--seed SEED]
                                [--threads THREADS] [--set SET] [--atol ATOL]
                                [--rtol RTOL] [--require-torch-parity]

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --baseline-repo BASELINE_REPO
  --candidate-repo CANDIDATE_REPO
  --config CONFIG
  --checkpoint CHECKPOINT
                        Trusted frozen model checkpoint; torch.load uses
                        weights_only=False.
  --output OUTPUT       A new output directory; existing results are never
                        overwritten.
  --seq-len SEQ_LEN
  --eager-seq-len EAGER_SEQ_LEN
  --eager-inputs EAGER_INPUTS
                        Optional torch-saved kwargs dict/list for real
                        multimodal eager stress.
  --include-full-text   Also compare a text-only full-model probe for
                        Qwen3-VL/Gemma4.
  --migrate-llama-rope  Explicitly rebuild candidate LLaMA RoPE from its
                        unified snapshot or recorded config. The baseline and
                        frozen qparams are unchanged.
  --decode-steps DECODE_STEPS
  --artifacts ARTIFACTS
                        Comma-separated Circle artifacts; auto selects LLaMA
                        bundle or VLM per-layer export.
  --seed SEED
  --threads THREADS
  --set SET
  --atol ATOL
  --rtol RTOL
  --require-torch-parity
                        Also require PyTorch-vs-Circle parity, not just
                        before-vs-after parity.
